{"type": "project", "schema_version": 1, "topic": "晏子使楚｜楚国三关", "audience": "小学高年级", "target_seconds": 180, "post": {"title": "如果你是晏子，会怎么接招？｜三分钟读懂《晏子使楚》", "description": "城门、大殿、宴席，楚王接连出了三道难题。跟着动画猜一猜晏子怎么答，再学着用「起因、经过、结果」复述课文。根据《晏子春秋》故事改编，旁白与动画使用 AI 辅助制作。", "tags": ["晏子使楚", "小学语文", "课文讲解", "晏子春秋", "故事动画", "阅读理解"]}, "sources": [{"id": "classic", "title": "《晏子春秋集释·内篇杂下》晏子使楚，大门与殿上两段", "url": "https://ctext.org/wiki.pl?chapter=894570&if=gb&remap=gb"}, {"id": "feast", "title": "《晏子春秋集释·内篇杂下》楚王欲辱晏子，晏子对以橘枳", "url": "https://ctext.org/wiki.pl?chapter=894570&if=gb&remap=gb"}]}
{"type": "scene", "id": "prologue", "kind": "html", "title": "楚国三关"}
{"type": "speak", "id": "visit", "scene_id": "prologue", "planned_start_ms": 0, "planned_end_ms": 5890, "text": "一扇大城门不开，旁边却留了一个小洞。换成你，要从这里钻进去吗？", "caption": "一扇大城门不开，旁边却留了一个小洞。换成你，要从这里钻进去吗？", "source_ids": ["classic"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "cue-visit", "scene_id": "prologue", "target": "prologue-picture", "planned_start_ms": 0, "planned_end_ms": 5890, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "visit", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "visit", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "name", "scene_id": "prologue", "planned_start_ms": 5890, "planned_end_ms": 11970, "text": "晏子名叫晏婴。春秋时期，他代表齐国出访楚国。使楚，就是出使楚国。", "caption": "晏子名叫晏婴。春秋时期，他代表齐国出访楚国。使楚，就是出使楚国。", "source_ids": ["classic"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "cue-name", "scene_id": "prologue", "target": "prologue-picture", "planned_start_ms": 5890, "planned_end_ms": 11970, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "name", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "name", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "stakes", "scene_id": "prologue", "planned_start_ms": 11970, "planned_end_ms": 17100, "text": "楚王想让他难堪，在城门、大殿和宴席上给他出了三道难题。", "caption": "楚王想让他难堪，在城门、大殿和宴席上给他出了三道难题。", "source_ids": ["classic"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "cue-stakes", "scene_id": "prologue", "target": "prologue-picture", "planned_start_ms": 11970, "planned_end_ms": 17100, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "stakes", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "stakes", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "scene", "id": "gate", "kind": "html", "title": "第一关 · 城门"}
{"type": "speak", "id": "hole", "scene_id": "gate", "planned_start_ms": 17650, "planned_end_ms": 23350, "text": "第一关，楚国人见晏子个子矮，就让他钻小洞。大门明明就在旁边！", "caption": "第一关，楚国人见晏子个子矮，就让他钻小洞。大门明明就在旁边！", "source_ids": ["classic"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "cue-hole", "scene_id": "gate", "target": "gate-picture", "planned_start_ms": 17650, "planned_end_ms": 23350, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "hole", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "hole", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "refuse", "scene_id": "gate", "planned_start_ms": 23350, "planned_end_ms": 30760, "text": "晏子停在门外，说，只有出使狗国，才从狗门进。请问，我今天来的是楚国，还是狗国？", "caption": "晏子停在门外，说，只有出使狗国，才从狗门进。请问，我今天来的是楚国，还是狗国？", "source_ids": ["classic"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "cue-refuse", "scene_id": "gate", "target": "gate-picture", "planned_start_ms": 23350, "planned_end_ms": 30760, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "refuse", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "refuse", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "open", "scene_id": "gate", "planned_start_ms": 30760, "planned_end_ms": 35510, "text": "接待的人只好打开大门。晏子挺直腰，从正门走了进去。", "caption": "接待的人只好打开大门。晏子挺直腰，从正门走了进去。", "source_ids": ["classic"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "cue-open", "scene_id": "gate", "target": "gate-picture", "planned_start_ms": 30760, "planned_end_ms": 35510, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "open", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "open", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "gate-why", "scene_id": "gate", "planned_start_ms": 35510, "planned_end_ms": 42160, "text": "再让晏子钻小门，就等于承认楚国是狗国。晏子用一句反问，把难题还了回去。", "caption": "再让晏子钻小门，就等于承认楚国是狗国。晏子用一句反问，把难题还了回去。", "source_ids": ["classic"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "cue-gate-why", "scene_id": "gate", "target": "gate-picture", "planned_start_ms": 35510, "planned_end_ms": 42160, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "gate-why", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "gate-why", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "scene", "id": "court", "kind": "html", "title": "第二关 · 大殿"}
{"type": "speak", "id": "king", "scene_id": "court", "planned_start_ms": 42710, "planned_end_ms": 48790, "text": "第二关，楚王说，齐国没人了吗？怎么派你来了？这话带着明显的轻视。", "caption": "第二关，楚王说，齐国没人了吗？怎么派你来了？这话带着明显的轻视。", "source_ids": ["classic"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "cue-king", "scene_id": "court", "target": "court-picture", "planned_start_ms": 42710, "planned_end_ms": 48790, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "king", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "king", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "crowd", "scene_id": "court", "planned_start_ms": 48790, "planned_end_ms": 55820, "text": "晏子先讲齐国都城临淄。街上人挨着人，举起袖子能遮住阳光，洒下的汗就像下雨。", "caption": "晏子先讲齐国都城临淄。街上人挨着人，举起袖子能遮住阳光，洒下的汗就像下雨。", "source_ids": ["classic"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "cue-crowd", "scene_id": "court", "target": "court-picture", "planned_start_ms": 48790, "planned_end_ms": 55820, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "crowd", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "crowd", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "crowd-why", "scene_id": "court", "planned_start_ms": 55820, "planned_end_ms": 63990, "text": "瞧，街上摩肩接踵，挤得肩碰肩。齐国的人多着呢！晏子接着说，派什么使者，要看去什么国家。", "caption": "瞧，街上摩肩接踵，挤得肩碰肩。齐国的人多着呢！晏子接着说，派什么使者，要看去什么国家。", "source_ids": ["classic"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "cue-crowd-why", "scene_id": "court", "target": "court-picture", "planned_start_ms": 55820, "planned_end_ms": 63990, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "crowd-why", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "crowd-why", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "mirror", "scene_id": "court", "planned_start_ms": 63990, "planned_end_ms": 71020, "text": "晏子故意说自己最不中用，所以就到楚国来了。再贬低晏子，就等于贬低楚国自己。", "caption": "晏子故意说自己最不中用，所以就到楚国来了。再贬低晏子，就等于贬低楚国自己。", "source_ids": ["classic"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "cue-mirror", "scene_id": "court", "target": "court-picture", "planned_start_ms": 63990, "planned_end_ms": 71020, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "mirror", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "mirror", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "court-why", "scene_id": "court", "planned_start_ms": 71020, "planned_end_ms": 75200, "text": "这一次，晏子先摆事实，再把楚王的话转了个弯。", "caption": "这一次，晏子先摆事实，再把楚王的话转了个弯。", "source_ids": ["classic"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "cue-court-why", "scene_id": "court", "target": "court-picture", "planned_start_ms": 71020, "planned_end_ms": 75200, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "court-why", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "court-why", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "scene", "id": "feast", "kind": "html", "title": "第三关 · 宴席"}
{"type": "speak", "id": "prisoner", "scene_id": "feast", "planned_start_ms": 75750, "planned_end_ms": 82780, "text": "第三关，差役押着一个犯人经过宴席。楚王问，他是齐国人，齐国人都爱偷东西吗？", "caption": "第三关，差役押着一个犯人经过宴席。楚王问，他是齐国人，齐国人都爱偷东西吗？", "source_ids": ["feast"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "cue-prisoner", "scene_id": "feast", "target": "feast-picture", "planned_start_ms": 75750, "planned_end_ms": 82780, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "prisoner", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "prisoner", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "one-all", "scene_id": "feast", "planned_start_ms": 82780, "planned_end_ms": 88100, "text": "一个人犯错，能代表所有人吗？晏子转过话头，讲了两种果子。", "caption": "一个人犯错，能代表所有人吗？晏子转过话头，讲了两种果子。", "source_ids": ["feast"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "cue-one-all", "scene_id": "feast", "target": "feast-picture", "planned_start_ms": 82780, "planned_end_ms": 88100, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "one-all", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "one-all", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "fruit", "scene_id": "feast", "planned_start_ms": 88100, "planned_end_ms": 96650, "text": "课文里的说法是，淮河以南结的是橘，到了淮河以北，就成了枳。两种果子的叶子相像，味道却不同。", "caption": "课文里的说法是，淮河以南结的是橘，到了淮河以北，就成了枳。两种果子的叶子相像，味道却不同。", "source_ids": ["feast"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "cue-fruit", "scene_id": "feast", "target": "feast-picture", "planned_start_ms": 88100, "planned_end_ms": 96650, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "fruit", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "fruit", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "turn", "scene_id": "feast", "planned_start_ms": 96650, "planned_end_ms": 104440, "text": "晏子借橘和枳打了个比方。那个人在齐国没偷，到楚国才偷。莫非，是楚国的水土让人变了？", "caption": "晏子借橘和枳打了个比方。那个人在齐国没偷，到楚国才偷。莫非，是楚国的水土让人变了？", "source_ids": ["feast"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "cue-turn", "scene_id": "feast", "target": "feast-picture", "planned_start_ms": 96650, "planned_end_ms": 104440, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "turn", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "turn", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "result", "scene_id": "feast", "planned_start_ms": 104440, "planned_end_ms": 113940, "text": "楚王听出来了，硬要照自己的说法推下去，自己的国家也会被说坏。他只好承认，想取笑晏子，结果取笑了自己。", "caption": "楚王听出来了，硬要照自己的说法推下去，自己的国家也会被说坏。他只好承认，想取笑晏子，结果取笑了自己。", "source_ids": ["feast"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "cue-result", "scene_id": "feast", "target": "feast-picture", "planned_start_ms": 104440, "planned_end_ms": 113940, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "result", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "result", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "scene", "id": "quiz", "kind": "html", "title": "轮到你 · 找出话里的意思"}
{"type": "speak", "id": "quiz-question", "scene_id": "quiz", "planned_start_ms": 114490, "planned_end_ms": 122660, "text": "轮到你啦。楚王说，齐国没人了吗？他的真正意思是什么？看屏幕上的两个答案，给自己几秒钟。", "caption": "轮到你啦。楚王说，齐国没人了吗？他的真正意思是什么？看屏幕上的两个答案，给自己几秒钟。", "source_ids": ["classic"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "cue-quiz-question", "scene_id": "quiz", "target": "quiz-picture", "planned_start_ms": 114490, "planned_end_ms": 122660, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "quiz-question", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "quiz-question", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "quiz-pause", "scene_id": "quiz", "planned_start_ms": 122660, "planned_end_ms": 126650, "text": "想一想。他是在认真打听，还是故意为难晏子？", "caption": "想一想。他是在认真打听，还是故意为难晏子？", "source_ids": ["classic"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "cue-quiz-pause", "scene_id": "quiz", "target": "quiz-picture", "planned_start_ms": 122660, "planned_end_ms": 126650, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "quiz-pause", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "quiz-pause", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "quiz-answer", "scene_id": "quiz", "planned_start_ms": 126650, "planned_end_ms": 135580, "text": "选第二个。读人物对话时，试试先听字面，再想他说这句话的用意。同一句话，换个场合，意思也可能变。", "caption": "选第二个。读人物对话时，试试先听字面，再想他说这句话的用意。同一句话，换个场合，意思也可能变。", "source_ids": ["classic"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "cue-quiz-answer", "scene_id": "quiz", "target": "quiz-picture", "planned_start_ms": 126650, "planned_end_ms": 135580, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "quiz-answer", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "quiz-answer", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "scene", "id": "recap", "kind": "html", "title": "三步复述课文"}
{"type": "speak", "id": "cause", "scene_id": "recap", "planned_start_ms": 136130, "planned_end_ms": 140310, "text": "复述先说起因，晏子出使楚国，楚王想让他难堪。", "caption": "复述先说起因，晏子出使楚国，楚王想让他难堪。", "source_ids": ["classic"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "cue-cause", "scene_id": "recap", "target": "recap-picture", "planned_start_ms": 136130, "planned_end_ms": 140310, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "cause", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "cause", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "events", "scene_id": "recap", "planned_start_ms": 140310, "planned_end_ms": 146010, "text": "再说经过，小门、齐国没人、一个犯人，三道难题，晏子一一化解。", "caption": "再说经过，小门、齐国没人、一个犯人，三道难题，晏子一一化解。", "source_ids": ["classic"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "cue-events", "scene_id": "recap", "target": "recap-picture", "planned_start_ms": 140310, "planned_end_ms": 146010, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "events", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "events", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "end", "scene_id": "recap", "planned_start_ms": 146010, "planned_end_ms": 153610, "text": "最后说结果，楚王服了，只好以礼相待。三次回击，晏子都找到了对方话里不合理的地方。", "caption": "最后说结果，楚王服了，只好以礼相待。三次回击，晏子都找到了对方话里不合理的地方。", "source_ids": ["classic"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "cue-end", "scene_id": "recap", "target": "recap-picture", "planned_start_ms": 146010, "planned_end_ms": 153610, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "end", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "end", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "prompt", "scene_id": "recap", "planned_start_ms": 153610, "planned_end_ms": 158930, "text": "现在挑一关讲给同桌听。楚王出了什么题？晏子是怎么接住的？", "caption": "现在挑一关讲给同桌听。楚王出了什么题？晏子是怎么接住的？", "source_ids": ["classic"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "cue-prompt", "scene_id": "recap", "target": "recap-picture", "planned_start_ms": 153610, "planned_end_ms": 158930, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "prompt", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "prompt", "point": "end"}}
